    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#DowntimePlan</IRI>
        <Literal>设备停机计划</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#Employee</IRI>
        <Literal>作业人员。能否操作某工序由 OperatorSkill 决定,不由岗位名称决定。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#Employee</IRI>
        <Literal>员工</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#Equipment</IRI>
        <Literal>设备台账。带理想节拍(ideal_cycle_s),这是 OEE 性能率的计算基准;额定功率用于能耗分析。设备状态(运行/待机/换型/停机/离线/报废)由采集数据推导。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#Equipment</IRI>
        <Literal>设备</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#EquipmentStateRecord</IRI>
        <Literal>设备状态的时间区间记录(运行/待机/换型/停机),是 OEE 与损失分析的原始依据。
OEE = 可用率 A × 性能率 P × 质量率 Q:
A = 运行时间 / 计划时间;
P = min(1, 理想节拍 × 总产量 / 运行时间);
Q = 合格数 / 总数。
损失分为:停机、换型换刀、待机等待、运行。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#EquipmentStateRecord</IRI>
        <Literal>设备状态记录</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#FinalInspection</IRI>
        <Literal>检验类型取值之一:出货。成品发货前的最终检验。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#FinalInspection</IRI>
        <Literal>出货检验</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#FinishedProduct</IRI>
