        <Literal>首检单。触发场景:开工、换型、换刀、换班、维修后。工艺步骤勾选「首检放行」时,该工序在放行前不得量产报工;首检判定不合格则不放行并登记 NCR。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#FirstArticleRelease</IRI>
        <Literal>首检放行</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
