        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#InspectionItem</IRI>
        <Literal>模板下的一条待检项:特性代码、量具类型、上下限、关键/特殊特性标记。首检放行的判定依据即这些项目的上下限。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#InspectionItem</IRI>
        <Literal>检验项目</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#InspectionRecord</IRI>
        <Literal>一次检验的执行结果,结论为合格/不合格/待判。检验类型为单值枚举,故其子类互斥。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#InspectionRecord</IRI>
        <Literal>检验记录</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#InspectionTemplate</IRI>
        <Literal>检验的模板定义,按物料或工序适用,含抽样规则。模板下挂检验项目,项目带上下限与关键特性标记。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#InspectionTemplate</IRI>
        <Literal>检验模板</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#InspectionValue</IRI>
        <Literal>单个检验项的实测值,绑定量具。合格判定按上下限,判定结论回写到检验记录。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#InspectionValue</IRI>
