    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#Material</IRI>
        <Literal>可被生产消耗或对外销售的对象,承载规格、单位、安全库存、单价、单重。物料类型(mtype)在系统中为单值枚举,故其子类互斥。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#Material</IRI>
        <Literal>物料</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#MaterialIssue</IRI>
        <Literal>工单领用或退回物料的流水,带批次维度。批次冻结期间,出库方向会被拦截。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
