        <Literal>物料的采购/制造属性:自制或外购、提前期、最小批量、批量倍数、安全库存、损耗率、默认供应商与默认仓库。MRP 运算按这些参数净算需求。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#MaterialPlan</IRI>
        <Literal>物料计划参数</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#MaterialRequest</IRI>
        <Literal>缺料时的请领单,挂在工单与仓库上。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#MaterialRequest</IRI>
        <Literal>物料申请</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#MrpRun</IRI>
        <Literal>一次物料需求计划运算,带计划期与运算状态;新运算取代旧运算。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#MrpRun</IRI>
        <Literal>MRP 运算</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#MrpSuggestion</IRI>
        <Literal>MRP 净算后的建议(计划生产/计划采购/提前/推迟),带需求 pegging 溯源与产能检查结果。可下发为生产工单或采购订单。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#MrpSuggestion</IRI>
        <Literal>MRP 建议</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#NonconformanceReport</IRI>
        <Literal>不合格品报告(NCR),带处置(待处置/返修/报废/让步接收/退供应商)与状态(待处理/评审中/已关闭)。首检不合格时自动登记 NCR 且不予放行。</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#NonconformanceReport</IRI>
